<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-month BUBOR rate firms, 3-mth steady.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-month BUBOR rate firms, 3-mth steady.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was fixed at 23.24 percent for the one-month maturity, up from 23.23, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The BUBOR remained steady for three months, at 23.10 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
